The change request asks to verify that the VPN will carry traffic from the workload subnet to the on-premises service at `192.168.50.10`. No live state has been collected yet; only the configuration above is available.

**Your task:** Review this change request. Identify any configuration inconsistencies or missing elements that would prevent the intended traffic flow. State what additional read-only evidence you would need to collect from either the Alibaba Cloud console/API or the Junos device to confirm your analysis. Do not propose any changes; this is a read-only investigation.

